## Creating a Change

A "change" in OpenSpec is a container for all the thinking and planning around a piece of work. It lives at the \`changeRoot\` reported by \`openspec status --change "<name>" --json\` and holds your artifacts\u2014proposal, specs, design, tasks.

Let me create one for our task.
\`\`\`

**DO:** Create the change with a derived kebab-case name:
\`\`\`bash
